    OR --> G3["GATE 3 incremental<br/>KV + KDA state, 20/20"]
    G1 --> CMP["final-position logits<br/>1024 bytes, byte for byte<br/>equal to the C binary"]
    G2 --> CMP
    G3 --> CMP
